                <div class="explanation_body wow animate__animated animate__fadeIn" data-wow-delay="0.7s" data-wow-duration="1s">
                    <p>
                        Koraw is a web application focused on managing and sharing artistic content between users, designed to encourage creative collaboration and content organization. Inspired by community-driven art events such as <i>Inktober</i> and <i>Art Fight</i>, it allows users to create private groups to share their work, organize events, and maintain personal or collaborative galleries.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <ul class="explanation_remarks wow animate__animated animate__fadeIn" data-wow-delay="0.9s" data-wow-duration="1s">
                    <li>
                        Secure user authentication with persistent session management.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Creation and management of private groups with content accessible only to members.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Image storage through a dedicated file storage system.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Event planning within a defined timeframe with different themes.
                    </li>
                </ul>
